---
const differentiators = [
  {
    title: "Senior engineer who teaches — not the inverse",
    body:
      "Teaching is informed by current production work (Hurdle today, Zappi and Babylon Health before that). The examples I reach for are from systems I've actually shipped this year, not a textbook I read once.",
  },
  {
    title: "Long-form formative reviews, not pass/fail grading",
    body:
      "When a student hands me a project, they get a structured, code-cited review with a prioritised plan — not a score. There's a real sample of one on this site.",
  },
  {
    title: "Bilingual teaching (Spanish ↔ English)",
    body:
      "Cohorts at 4Geeks are bilingual; my course companion repo is published in both languages. Useful for global cohorts and for Spanish-speaking learners who otherwise get worse material.",
  },
  {
    title: "Builds learning artifacts in the open",
    body:
      "The Python book, the cohort companion repo, this very site — all public, all iterated on. Teaching is a craft I keep working at, not a side gig I switch on twice a month.",
  },
];
---

<section id="why-me" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-20">
  <div class="max-w-3xl">
    <p class="section-title">Why me</p>
    <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
      A fair question — let me answer it directly.
    </h2>

    <blockquote class="mt-6 border-l-2 border-[color:var(--color-accent-warm)] pl-4 text-lg text-[color:var(--color-text)] leading-relaxed">
      Honestly, I love teaching. I find helping people understand something
      new genuinely rewarding — that's been the constant through TA work at
      university, six years at 4Geeks Academy, and now writing a Python
      handbook in my spare time.
    </blockquote>

    <p class="mt-6 text-[color:var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
      If you'd like the bullet-point version of what sets me apart from
      another bootcamp instructor:
    </p>
  </div>

  <ul class="mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
    {
      differentiators.map((d, i) => (
        <li class="flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-[color:var(--color-border)] bg-[color:var(--color-surface)]/60 p-5">
          <span class="mt-0.5 font-mono text-sm text-[color:var(--color-accent-warm)] shrink-0">
            0{i + 1}
          </span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-[color:var(--color-text)]">{d.title}</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-[color:var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
              {d.body}
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ul>
</section>
